Z||000001||theogre||11-26-2000||01:17 PM||||Don't know where you heard that...... I've never heard of GM putting more than one of these bloody things in any car. No reason to under any normal conditions. It's not considered a safety item. To the best of my knowledge it's only legally required function is the seatbelt light timmer/buzzer, which has no effect on the car if it doesn't work.<P>so far the only service issue I can find at all with these is the defect problem that is descibed in my cave article. If it doesn't work either you have the defect in my article or it's truely dead in what case you just shove another one in.||||reg||1
